{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50366","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十九、凿壁井咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十九、凿壁井咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻凿壁井，兹水最爲灵。\n色带三春渌，芳传一味清。\n玄言称上善，图录着高名。\n德重胜铢两，诸流量[三六]且轻。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}